<title>FRANCE: Paribas wins Italian primary dealer status.</title>
<headline>Paribas wins Italian primary dealer status.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Paribas said on Tuesday that the Bank of Italy had made it a primary dealer in Italian government securities.</p>
<p>&quot;This recognition marks an important step in the development of Paribas' activities in Italian markets where the bank is already a major player, especially in the field of bonds and derivatives,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
